            {
              "text": "Prayer set a hard geometry problem",
              "size": "hook",
              "at": 0.0,
              "until": 3.56
            },
            {
              "text": "Raqqa, Syria, the 800s",
              "sub": "an astronomer, Al-Battani, works here",
              "size": "h1",
              "at": 3.9,
              "until": 9.21
            },
            {
              "text": "Five times a day, face Makkah",
              "sub": "from any village on a round earth",
              "size": "h1",
              "at": 9.55,
              "until": 15.26
            },
            {
              "text": "On a flat page a triangle makes 180",
              "size": "h1",
              "at": 15.6,
              "until": 19.19
            },
            {
              "text": "On a ball it always makes more",
              "size": "h1",
              "at": 19.53,
              "until": 22.74
            },
            {
              "text": "So the way to Makkah is an arc",
              "sub": "not a straight line on a flat map",
              "size": "h1",
              "at": 23.08,
              "until": 29.01
            },
            {
              "text": "The old flat rules quietly fail",
              "size": "h1",
              "at": 29.35,
              "until": 32.58
            },
            {
              "text": "So he built the mathematics of curves",
              "sub": "your GPS still uses triangles on a ball",
